    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="purpose">
      <h2 id="purpose">Purpose</h2>
      
      <p>Explain the synthetic landed cost and overhead build-up calculation.</p>

      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="the-rule">
      <h2 id="the-rule">The rule</h2>
      
      <p>Landed cost sums the line extension, freight, duty and setup before applying overhead on the cost base and markup at the final price stage.</p>

      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="how-it-works">
      <h2 id="how-it-works">How it works</h2>
      
      <p>Each stage rounds half away from zero to cents at the named stage boundaries, and totals sum the rounded extensions.</p>

      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="worked-example">
      <h2 id="worked-example">Worked example</h2>
      
      <p>Synthetic example. The numbers are made up.</p>
<p>Fixture: CALC-01</p>
<figure class="panel calc">
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table>
      <caption>Calculation case CALC-01</caption>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">Output</th><th scope="col">Unit</th><th scope="col" class="r">Value</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        
        <tr>
          <td>unit</td>
          <td>USD</td>
          <td class="num">9.00</td>
        </tr>
        
        <tr>
          <td>extension</td>
          <td>USD</td>
          <td class="num">1,800.00</td>
        </tr>
        
        <tr>
          <td>landed</td>
          <td>USD</td>
          <td class="num">2,050.00</td>
        </tr>
        
        <tr>
          <td>labour</td>
          <td>USD</td>
          <td class="num">450.00</td>
        </tr>
        
        <tr>
          <td>overhead</td>
          <td>USD</td>
          <td class="num">90.00</td>
        </tr>
        
        <tr>
          <td>cost</td>
          <td>USD</td>
          <td class="num">2,590.00</td>
        </tr>
        
        <tr>
          <td>profit</td>
          <td>USD</td>
          <td class="num">259.00</td>
        </tr>
        
        <tr>
          <td>price</td>
          <td>USD</td>
          <td class="num">2,849.00</td>
        </tr>
        
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p class="calc-foot">
    <span>Computed by the calc core, not a model</span>
    <span>Each extension rounds half away from zero to cents; totals sum the rounded extensions.</span>
    <span class="ok">Fixture CALC-01: pass</span>
  </p>
</figure>
      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="never-confuse">
      <h2 id="never-confuse">Never confuse</h2>
      
      <p>Do not confuse a <span class="term" data-pv="term:cost_baseline" data-pv-title="cost baseline" data-pv-body="Synthetic time-phased budget basis used to measure synthetic estimating variance.">cost baseline</span> build-up with margin pricing on selling price.</p>

      
      
    </section>

